ishment [i.e., Hellfire].","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":87,"sd":null},{"k":"18:88","t":"But as for one who believes and does righteousness, he will have a reward of the best [i.e., Paradise], and we [i.e., Dhul-Qarnayn] will speak to him from our command with ease.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":88,"sd":null},{"k":"18:89","t":"Then he followed a way","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":89,"sd":null},{"k":"18:90","t":"Until, when he came to the rising of the sun [i.e., the east], he found it rising on a people for whom We had not made against it any shield.","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":90,"sd":null},{"k":"18:91","t":"Thus. And We had encompassed [all] that he had in knowledge.","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":91,"sd":null},{"k":"18:92","t":"Then he followed a way.","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":92,"sd":null},{"k":"18:93","t":"Until, when he reached [a pass] between two mountains, he found beside them a people who could hardly understand [his] speech.","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":93,"sd":null},{"k":"18:94","t":"They said, \"O Dhul-Qarnayn, indeed Gog and Magog are [great] corrupters in the land. So may we assign for you an expenditure that you might make between us and them a barrier?\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":94,"sd":null},{"k":"18:95","t":"He said, \"That in which my Lord has established me is better [than what you offer], but assist me with strength [i.e., manpower]; I will make between you and them a dam.","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":95,"sd":null},{"k":"18:96","t":"Bring me bars of iron\" - until, when he had leveled [them] between the two mountain walls, he said, \"Blow [with bellows],\" until when he had made it [like] fire, he said, \"Bring me, that I may pour over it molten copper.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":96,"sd":null},{"k":"18:97","t":"So they [i.e., Gog and Magog] were unable to pass over it, nor were they able [to effect] in it any penetration.","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":97,"sd":null}],"juz":16,"hizb":31,"surahs":[18],"sajdah":false}